### Summary

Typing \"/\" in the New task field will put the page in a render loop. `edited(setPrompt)` is a new function on every `SpawnPage` render, so `select` and `panel` in `useSkillSuggestions` are new each time. The effect that pushes `panel` into `SpawnPage` state then fires every render. The tests miss this because they pass stable props. I also flagged one garbled comment in `app/spawn.tsx`. The rest looks sound: the backend route exists, a 404 maps to an empty list, and the remembered-skills cleanup matches the sibling turn-options path.

